mzid:term-ifr-ApprovalRecord a mz:OntologyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "ifr:ApprovalRecord"@en ;
    mz:basis mz:Specializes ;
    mz:definedBy "0026-works-versioning FR-013" ;
    mz:justification "The approving is a PROV-O activity of an agent in a role (prov:Association and prov:hadRole); the record of it is an entity. ISO 9001:2015 clause 7.5.3 and ISO 13485:2016 clause 4.2.4 ask for the approval of a controlled document before its use" ;
    mz:mappingRelation "subClassOf" ;
    mz:standardTerm "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity" ;
    mz:termIri "https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#ApprovalRecord" .

mzid:term-ifr-Citation a mz:OntologyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "ifr:Citation"@en ;
    mz:addedOn "2026-11-17" ;
    mz:basis mz:Unaligned ;
    mz:definedBy "0026-works-versioning FR-024" ;
    mz:justification "No standard adopted yet. Examined: The Citation File Format 1.2.0 is a file format with a JSON Schema and no RDF vocabulary; schema.org has the property citation, which points at a work cited and not at how a work is cited; DataCite's metadata schema and CodeMeta (to verify) describe a work's metadata, not the citation of it as a file. Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005)." ;
    mz:termIri "https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Citation" .

mzid:term-ifr-Edition a mz:OntologyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "ifr:Edition"@en ;
    mz:addedOn "2026-11-17" ;
    mz:basis mz:Unaligned ;
    mz:definedBy "0026-works-versioning FR-011" ;
    mz:justification "No standard adopted yet. Examined: schema.org has bookEdition, a property whose value is text, not a class of what an edition is; the Bibliographic Ontology's edition is a property too (to verify); IFLA LRM has no edition among its entities, only the attribute 'edition statement' of a manifestation (to verify). None defines an edition as a release of published prose. Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005)." ;
    mz:termIri "https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Edition" .

mzid:term-ifr-Expression a mz:OntologyTerm ;
    rdfs:label "ifr:Expression"@en ;
    mz:basis mz:Specializes ;
    mz:definedBy "0026-works-versioning FR-003" ;
    mz:justification "LRM's Expression. schema.org's CreativeWork names no level of a work, and IFLA LRM (Work, Expression, Manifestation, Item; its namespace and IRIs are to verify) and FRBR do, so the class is a CreativeWork and the level is kept by the properties that join them" ;
    mz:mappingRelation "subClassOf" ;
    mz:standardTerm "https://schema.org/CreativeWork" ;
    mz:termIri "https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifr#Expression" .

